fferential test (dlopen both `.so`, bit-compare every function incl. out-params, mutated structs, caches, NaN/±Inf/FLT_MAX, dense `reverse_collide` grid) | **61,685,763 checks, 0 mismatches** |\n| Rust vs C at `-O0/-O1/-O2/-O3/-Os/-Og` and clang 15 `-O2` | 0 mismatches in all 7 builds |\n\n(Only `-march=native`/`-ffast-math` C builds diverge — that's GCC contracting into FMA, which no strict-IEEE translation can match; the stock CMake build sets no such flags.)\n\n`c_src/` is untouched (still exactly 4 files), and all temporary build/test artifacts were removed — the deliverable is just `translation/Cargo.toml` + `translation/src/lib.rs`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":69441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"367dfc05-9510-4f2d-9854-950d131982c8","uuid":"b2661d1b-4794-48b0-a1c8-964fc8e44c87","timestamp":"2026-08-27T15:59:21.456Z"}
